WEBVTT

01:30.539 --> 01:34.970
[The Heir]

01:35.410 --> 01:37.810
[Episode 8]

01:39.240 --> 01:41.940
[Li Ink]

01:45.229 --> 01:46.229
Please take another look.

01:46.229 --> 01:47.590
This is medium-grade quality.

01:47.590 --> 01:48.560
Cut the crap.

01:49.229 --> 01:50.430
One catty and 6 taels.

01:56.039 --> 01:56.710
Next.

01:59.400 --> 02:00.120
I'm here to collect tools

02:00.120 --> 02:01.180
and raw materials.

02:10.910 --> 02:11.960
Your family

02:12.080 --> 02:13.880
has been expelled from the clan,

02:14.030 --> 02:15.230
and your grandfather

02:15.590 --> 02:17.250
swore never to make ink again.

02:17.680 --> 02:18.280
What,

02:18.800 --> 02:19.910
the old man

02:19.910 --> 02:20.960
got the itch to do it again

02:20.960 --> 02:22.590
but was too ashamed to show his face,

02:22.590 --> 02:24.430
so he sent you to sneak in
and muddle through?

02:24.430 --> 02:26.630
Don't you dare slander my grandfather.

02:26.710 --> 02:28.430
I've been studying ink-making for 3 years.

02:28.430 --> 02:30.280
What's so hard about
making some lampblack?

02:30.280 --> 02:31.540
You study ink-making?

02:32.520 --> 02:34.380
She says she studies ink-making.

02:37.000 --> 02:38.200
Since ancient times,

02:38.240 --> 02:40.870
I've never heard of a female ink-maker.

02:41.430 --> 02:42.150
Drive her out.

02:42.150 --> 02:42.590
She's just wasting my time.

02:42.590 --> 02:43.120
Young lady, please go home.

02:43.120 --> 02:43.560
Go on. Go on.

02:43.560 --> 02:45.960
Who says women can't
make ink or lampblack?

02:46.120 --> 02:47.910
Which rule says so?

02:48.280 --> 02:49.540
If you can show it to me,

02:49.590 --> 02:50.840
I'll leave immediately.

02:50.840 --> 02:52.030
But if you can't,

02:52.960 --> 02:55.490
then I'll go ask
the Seventh Old Madam myself.

02:57.030 --> 02:57.579
Alright then.

02:57.579 --> 02:58.230
Hold on.

03:06.490 --> 03:08.230
We don't accept defective goods.

03:08.230 --> 03:10.030
The price for low-grade ink is 200 wen,

03:10.030 --> 03:11.430
and each grade above that

03:11.630 --> 03:12.840
adds another 200 wen.

03:13.120 --> 03:14.180
I'll take 20 lamps.

03:16.310 --> 03:17.590
I'm not finished yet.

03:17.710 --> 03:19.030
The rule of Li Ink

03:19.430 --> 03:21.079
is that no matter the quality,

03:21.079 --> 03:21.910
we only buy

03:22.310 --> 03:23.570
starting from 1 catty.

03:24.120 --> 03:24.910
One catty?

03:30.310 --> 03:31.840
So, are you taking it or not?

03:31.960 --> 03:33.800
If you are, sign here.

03:34.240 --> 03:35.190
If not,

03:35.430 --> 03:36.760
then hurry up and leave.

03:43.120 --> 03:44.400
Burning 20 lamps of oil

03:44.400 --> 03:45.750
to make 1 catty of lampblack?

03:45.750 --> 03:46.560
Young lady,

03:46.680 --> 03:48.000
aren't you talking big?

03:48.000 --> 03:50.600
For a grown man, you sure
ask a lot of questions.

03:51.190 --> 03:53.190
It's just 1 catty of lampblack, isn't it?

03:53.190 --> 03:54.000
For 20 lamps,

03:54.000 --> 03:55.329
if I burn them for 6 days,

03:55.430 --> 03:56.630
I'll finish it eventually.

03:56.630 --> 03:57.400
Six days?

03:58.280 --> 03:59.880
Stop wasting words with her.

04:00.910 --> 04:02.240
Hurry up and sign.

04:02.240 --> 04:03.430
People are waiting.

04:03.430 --> 04:04.080
I know.

04:09.270 --> 04:12.590
[Contracting Party: Li Zhen]

04:19.560 --> 04:20.890
Delivery within 4 days.

04:21.160 --> 04:22.620
Do not delay the schedule.

04:23.600 --> 04:24.560
Within 4 days?

04:25.800 --> 04:28.040
I-It doesn't say that anywhere on here!

04:28.120 --> 04:29.480
Collecting lamps and making lampblack

04:28.490 --> 04:31.080
[Seventh Grandmother's grandniece,
Wang Hua'er]

04:29.480 --> 04:31.360
has always been a 4-day cycle.

04:31.390 --> 04:32.600
You've studied ink-making for 3 years,

04:32.600 --> 04:33.750
yet you seem to know absolutely nothing.

04:33.750 --> 04:34.720
Sun Baiyi!

04:34.720 --> 04:35.240
Hold on.

04:35.310 --> 04:36.710
Let me do the math for you.

04:37.360 --> 04:38.120
In 1 day,

04:38.120 --> 04:39.870
you can burn 20 lamps.

04:40.000 --> 04:41.480
In 4 days,

04:41.800 --> 04:43.480
excluding all the wastage,

04:43.560 --> 04:44.800
that only makes 8 taels of lampblack,

04:44.800 --> 04:45.630
right?

04:45.630 --> 04:47.190
No matter how you calculate it,

04:47.190 --> 04:48.800
you won't be able to deliver enough.

04:48.800 --> 04:49.630
That's right.

04:49.720 --> 04:50.870
Can you make it?

04:50.870 --> 04:51.510
Can you guys?

04:51.510 --> 04:52.480
-We can't.
-We can't.

04:52.480 --> 04:53.750
But since you already signed,

04:53.750 --> 04:55.800
there's no way
you're getting your deposit back.

04:55.800 --> 04:57.190
You won't make enough anyway,

04:57.190 --> 04:58.720
so why don't you just go home

04:59.430 --> 05:00.630
and cry to your grandfather?

05:00.630 --> 05:01.920
Who says I can't?

05:03.560 --> 05:04.390
At worst,

05:05.190 --> 05:06.720
I'll just add 10 more lamps.

05:07.040 --> 05:08.310
Ten more lamps?

05:08.920 --> 05:10.480
Back in the day, even Eighth Master Li

05:10.480 --> 05:12.480
only managed 35 lamps at most
in the workshop.

05:12.480 --> 05:13.870
And you want 10 more?

05:13.950 --> 05:14.510
Come on.

05:14.600 --> 05:15.120
Exactly.

05:15.120 --> 05:16.480
Even the master ink makers in the workshop

05:16.480 --> 05:18.070
wouldn't dare guarantee

05:18.070 --> 05:20.270
they could tend to 30 lamps at once.

05:20.430 --> 05:22.160
You better think this through.

05:22.360 --> 05:25.560
If you fail to deliver 1 catty of
usable lampblack by then,

05:25.610 --> 05:28.480
you won't see a penny of the deposit
for those 30 lamps.

05:28.480 --> 05:30.430
Even if the Old Madam herself comes,

05:30.430 --> 05:32.070
you won't have a leg to stand on.

05:32.070 --> 05:33.040
Cut the chatter.

05:33.120 --> 05:33.870
Hurry up.

05:35.830 --> 05:36.720
Here you are.

05:36.750 --> 05:38.310
Go collect the tools and raw materials.

05:38.310 --> 05:39.070
Any later

05:39.070 --> 05:40.390
and you won't make it at all.

05:40.390 --> 05:41.950
What an eye-opener today!

05:42.000 --> 05:43.680
A bunch of shameless scumbags
bullying someone—

05:43.680 --> 05:45.080
it's honestly pathetic!

05:45.560 --> 05:46.390
Hua'er?

05:47.870 --> 05:48.360
Hua'er.

05:48.480 --> 05:50.480
Where have you been all these years?

05:50.830 --> 05:51.240
At first,

05:51.240 --> 05:53.510
I planned to set sail from Yuegang
in Zhangzhou

05:53.510 --> 05:56.270
and head back to Europa,
my mother's ancestral homeland.

05:56.270 --> 05:58.240
But the maritime ban was too strict,

05:58.240 --> 05:59.900
and we couldn't get out at all.

05:59.950 --> 06:00.920
But you know

06:00.920 --> 06:01.630
my dad—

06:01.630 --> 06:03.160
he's the type who can never sit still.

06:03.160 --> 06:04.510
Trading goods all the way
from north to south,

06:04.510 --> 06:05.800
he took us to many places.

06:05.800 --> 06:07.240
I'm telling you,
they were absolutely beautiful.

06:07.240 --> 06:08.370
And you've picked up

06:08.390 --> 06:10.050
quite a lot of vulgar talk too.

06:12.270 --> 06:13.310
But Zhen,

06:13.560 --> 06:16.040
why do you need so many
tools and raw materials?

06:16.040 --> 06:17.040
Don't even get me started.

06:17.040 --> 06:19.870
It's all because of that Sun Baiyi—
he totally set a trap for me.

06:19.870 --> 06:21.600
I just lost my head for a second.

06:22.190 --> 06:22.800
It's okay.

06:23.120 --> 06:24.680
Things will work out somehow.

06:24.680 --> 06:25.830
Well, ladies,

06:26.390 --> 06:27.360
this is way too much

06:27.280 --> 06:29.040
[Doggie, Ink-Maker, Li Ink]

06:27.360 --> 06:27.950
for you to carry.

06:27.950 --> 06:29.160
Let me deliver it for you.

06:29.160 --> 06:29.950
Thanks a lot.

06:30.070 --> 06:30.750
Done.

06:30.750 --> 06:31.390
Let me.

06:33.430 --> 06:34.230
Alright then,

06:34.360 --> 06:35.310
let's go.

06:35.630 --> 06:36.120
Okay.

06:38.040 --> 06:39.000
Be careful.

06:39.000 --> 06:39.480
Okay.

06:39.920 --> 06:40.800
Thanks a lot.

06:43.920 --> 06:44.560
Master.

06:46.610 --> 06:47.740
Please come inside.

06:48.000 --> 06:48.930
Watch your step.

06:49.040 --> 06:49.680
Greetings, Master Tian.

06:49.680 --> 06:50.070
Everyone.

06:50.070 --> 06:51.020
Greetings, Master Tian.

06:51.020 --> 06:51.510
Greetings, Master Tian.

06:51.510 --> 06:52.800
Welcome. Welcome.

06:52.820 --> 06:54.260
Your ink is really good.

06:55.480 --> 06:56.480
Thank you. Thank you.

06:56.480 --> 06:57.010
Alright.

06:58.310 --> 06:58.680
Master.

06:58.680 --> 07:00.870
Our business is flourishing.

07:00.870 --> 07:01.530
It truly is.

07:04.120 --> 07:05.120
For salaries

07:05.240 --> 07:06.240
and miscellaneous expenses,

07:06.240 --> 07:08.310
it comes to 1,345 taels.

07:08.560 --> 07:09.390
Mr. Xu,

07:09.750 --> 07:11.410
please come here for a moment.

07:12.070 --> 07:13.800
Master, I'll go there for a bit.

07:14.600 --> 07:15.600
My Lady.

07:16.430 --> 07:17.310
Take a look here.

07:17.310 --> 07:18.440
This entry is wrong.

07:19.560 --> 07:20.190
Let me have a look.

07:20.190 --> 07:21.590
It should be this number.

07:23.560 --> 07:25.090
I really did make a mistake.

07:25.870 --> 07:28.270
You're truly good at calculating, My Lady.

07:28.830 --> 07:29.480
Ronghua.

07:30.920 --> 07:31.560
Ronghua?

07:32.470 --> 07:33.330
My dear sister,

07:33.390 --> 07:35.070
hurry and advance me 50 taels of silver.

07:35.070 --> 07:35.930
Put it on my tab.

07:36.190 --> 07:37.870
I'm definitely going to meet

07:37.870 --> 07:39.540
the "Lady Scholar"
by Xin'an River tonight.

07:39.540 --> 07:40.780
Advance?

07:41.070 --> 07:42.000
Advance my foot!

07:42.560 --> 07:43.750
Father, you're here.

07:43.750 --> 07:45.409
Don't give him a single penny.

07:46.430 --> 07:47.600
All you do every day

07:47.600 --> 07:49.600
is squander money on wine and women.

07:49.750 --> 07:51.240
Can't you show some ambition for once?

07:51.240 --> 07:52.370
Learn from Benchang

07:52.750 --> 07:55.150
and make some contribution to
our Tian Ink.

07:55.240 --> 07:55.920
Father.

07:56.870 --> 07:58.870
But I don't know anything about ink.

07:59.040 --> 08:00.000
If you really make me help,

08:00.000 --> 08:02.370
aren't you worried
I'll just make things worse?

08:02.370 --> 08:04.170
Just look at how useless you are.

08:04.870 --> 08:05.430
Father.

08:05.830 --> 08:07.920
Guess who I just saw.

08:09.270 --> 08:10.160
Who?

08:11.160 --> 08:12.630
Zhen from the Li family.

08:14.120 --> 08:16.680
She studied ink-making under Li Jinshui
for a few years, you know.

08:16.680 --> 08:17.680
Now she's full of herself,

08:17.680 --> 08:20.630
thinking she's become one of
the Five Ink-making Grandmasters.

08:20.630 --> 08:22.870
She actually went to Li's Ink Workshop,
from which she was expelled,

08:22.870 --> 08:25.070
to collect lamps for lampblack making.

08:26.040 --> 08:27.070
Are you serious?

08:30.430 --> 08:31.870
I saw it with my own eyes.

08:33.600 --> 08:35.789
Benchang still cares so much about her.

08:35.789 --> 08:38.200
Could it be you still have feelings
for her?

08:39.270 --> 08:40.510
Listen up, everyone.

08:41.270 --> 08:42.270
First of all,

08:43.200 --> 08:44.670
Li Zhen

08:45.150 --> 08:47.410
can't possibly make any good lampblack.

08:47.440 --> 08:48.200
Secondly,

08:48.720 --> 08:51.150
to think that the great leader
of the Five Ink-making Grandmasters

08:51.150 --> 08:54.720
actually has to resort to using
his own granddaughter as a front—

08:54.720 --> 08:56.750
it's utterly ridiculous.

09:01.600 --> 09:02.600
That Sun Baiyi,

09:02.600 --> 09:04.120
just because he's Sister-in-law's brother
in the clan,

09:04.120 --> 09:06.960
he actually thinks he's some
royal brother-in-law to the Emperor.

09:06.960 --> 09:08.720
Look at him bullying Zhen like that.

09:08.720 --> 09:10.360
Not only did he trick her into
collecting 30 lamps,

09:10.360 --> 09:13.320
but he's also demanding
a full catty of lampblack within 4 days.

09:13.320 --> 09:13.960
Father.

09:14.550 --> 09:16.200
Why don't you give Zhen some pointers?

09:16.200 --> 09:17.750
She's been sitting there frozen
all afternoon

09:17.750 --> 09:18.840
without even lighting a single lamp.

09:18.840 --> 09:19.390
I'm afraid

09:19.390 --> 09:21.450
the pressure is just too much for her.

09:47.550 --> 09:48.750
Besides ink-making,

09:50.910 --> 09:52.440
what else have I taught you?

09:53.480 --> 09:54.390
You said,

09:55.000 --> 09:56.790
"One must hone oneself
through practical affairs

09:56.790 --> 09:57.960
to stand firm.

09:58.910 --> 10:00.670
Only then can one remain composed

10:00.670 --> 10:02.000
both in stillness and in motion."

10:02.000 --> 10:03.060
These are the words

10:03.550 --> 10:05.000
of the Earl of Xinjian,

10:05.630 --> 10:07.360
and I, too, hold them to be  true.

10:09.120 --> 10:11.920
Although you've achieved
some minor success now,

10:13.360 --> 10:14.390
in the end,

10:14.480 --> 10:15.820
you remain unhardened by trials

10:15.820 --> 10:18.010
and are unable to precisely control
the quality of the lampblack.

10:18.010 --> 10:21.720
You should guard against arrogance and rashness,
and focus entirely on refining your craft.

10:21.720 --> 10:23.780
Why, then, have you grown complacent

10:24.080 --> 10:25.810
and taken such a reckless risk?

10:27.360 --> 10:28.320
Grandfather.

10:29.870 --> 10:31.150
I know I was wrong.

10:31.550 --> 10:32.110
Father.

10:32.670 --> 10:34.080
Zhen knows she was wrong.

10:34.320 --> 10:35.030
Moreover,

10:35.030 --> 10:36.910
it's not entirely her fault.

10:37.080 --> 10:38.240
Just give her some pointers.

10:38.240 --> 10:39.240
She has already completed
her apprenticeship.

10:39.240 --> 10:40.390
Since she has such confidence,

10:40.390 --> 10:40.960
let her clean up

10:40.960 --> 10:41.870
her own mess.

10:41.870 --> 10:43.530
It'll be a good lesson for her.

10:45.120 --> 10:45.840
Father.

10:50.510 --> 10:51.120
Mother.

10:52.750 --> 10:54.320
I can manage this on my own.

10:54.790 --> 10:56.450
I won't trouble Grandfather.

11:04.000 --> 11:05.120
Did Zhen

11:05.480 --> 11:08.080
really come to the smoke shed
to collect lamps?

11:08.670 --> 11:09.750
Seventh Grandmother.

11:09.750 --> 11:12.320
That Sun Baiyi really
bullied her terribly.

11:13.120 --> 11:15.440
You must help Zhen
give him a piece of her mind

11:15.440 --> 11:16.700
and teach him a lesson.

11:18.840 --> 11:20.480
I'd actually like

11:20.550 --> 11:22.480
to see how Zhen

11:22.720 --> 11:24.910
handles this matter.

11:27.480 --> 11:28.740
Seventh Grandmother.

11:29.080 --> 11:31.150
You used to care about Zhen the most.

11:31.630 --> 11:32.960
But now,

11:33.910 --> 11:35.770
why do you stand by and do nothing?

11:36.150 --> 11:37.320
Hua'er.

11:37.750 --> 11:38.840
I

11:38.960 --> 11:40.910
will eventually grow old one day,

11:41.870 --> 11:43.550
and you younger generation

11:44.240 --> 11:45.600
will eventually

11:45.700 --> 11:47.300
have to stand on your own.

11:47.550 --> 11:49.550
My standing by now

11:49.790 --> 11:52.270
is to help you guys grow.

11:57.790 --> 11:59.360
What's wrong with me?

11:59.960 --> 12:02.550
I was clearly able to make
supreme-grade lampblack before,

12:02.550 --> 12:05.010
but why can't I even make
the fine-grade now?

12:10.080 --> 12:11.480
Your mind is not at peace,

12:11.670 --> 12:13.330
so of course you can't make it.

12:14.790 --> 12:15.360
Zhen,

12:15.600 --> 12:16.200
come here.

12:17.080 --> 12:19.410
Mother made some vegetable cakes for you.

12:22.620 --> 12:25.750
How come you haven't touched
the ones from this morning?

12:25.840 --> 12:26.900
I have no appetite.

12:27.390 --> 12:28.030
Come on,

12:28.030 --> 12:29.960
eat them while they're still warm.

12:33.910 --> 12:34.640
Zhengliang,

12:35.200 --> 12:39.000
can a peaceful mind truly allow one
to light 30 lamps at the same time?

12:40.390 --> 12:41.520
Even more than that.

12:42.670 --> 12:43.630
A peaceful mind

12:43.670 --> 12:44.600
means

12:44.960 --> 12:46.600
the ultimate truth is found
in absolute simplicity.

12:46.600 --> 12:48.320
With zero distractions,

12:50.450 --> 12:51.550
there's nothing else in this universe

12:51.550 --> 12:52.790
except the lamps and yourself.

12:52.790 --> 12:54.590
In such a state of supreme focus,

12:54.840 --> 12:57.300
even lighting 35 lamps
would be effortless.

13:01.000 --> 13:03.000
These words definitely aren't yours.

13:03.000 --> 13:05.260
You went to ask Grandfather, didn't you?

13:07.080 --> 13:09.280
Well, I saw you were really distressed.

13:09.910 --> 13:10.840
But you know,

13:11.320 --> 13:13.510
Grandfather is a man with a sharp tongue
but a soft heart.

13:13.510 --> 13:14.910
Seeing that I couldn't remember it,

13:14.910 --> 13:16.790
he purposely repeated it several times,

13:16.790 --> 13:18.990
just waiting for me to come and tell you.

13:22.440 --> 13:23.790
Grandfather is right.

13:24.840 --> 13:26.750
I was too obsessed with the time limit,

13:26.750 --> 13:29.350
filled with anxiety,
and acting like a coward.

13:29.440 --> 13:32.900
How could I possibly make good lampblack
with a mind like that?

13:33.630 --> 13:34.430
It's better to

13:34.840 --> 13:36.670
discard all of this completely,

13:37.030 --> 13:38.630
and start anew from scratch.

13:41.750 --> 13:42.610
Come on, eat up.

14:49.510 --> 14:50.200
Hold on.

14:51.030 --> 14:52.230
Open it and let me see.

15:04.070 --> 15:06.030
There's something wrong
with your lampblack.

15:06.030 --> 15:07.160
How dare you fake it?

15:07.170 --> 15:08.670
Save your malicious slander.

15:08.670 --> 15:10.440
Use those eyes of yours to look closely,

15:10.440 --> 15:12.900
rub it between your fingers,
and you'll see.

15:13.200 --> 15:14.360
Sure. I'll rub it.

15:31.270 --> 15:32.430
Everyone else's lampblack

15:32.430 --> 15:33.510
is pitch-black,

15:33.790 --> 15:34.390
but yours—

15:34.390 --> 15:35.080
look—

15:35.270 --> 15:36.910
why does it have a grayish tint?

15:36.910 --> 15:37.790
You're young,

15:37.790 --> 15:39.840
yet you already act like
a slippery old fox.

15:39.840 --> 15:41.390
Too bad your craftsmanship is lacking.

15:41.390 --> 15:43.120
Trying to play mind games with me?

15:43.120 --> 15:43.960
No way.

15:44.600 --> 15:45.260
Weigh it.

15:53.960 --> 15:55.000
One catty and 2 taels.

15:55.000 --> 15:56.200
One catty and 2 taels?

15:58.440 --> 16:00.270
How much fake material
did you mix into this?

16:00.270 --> 16:01.670
I'll say it one more time:

16:02.240 --> 16:03.270
I didn't fake it.

16:05.550 --> 16:06.680
You two, take a look.

16:07.000 --> 16:08.750
See if I'm right.

16:19.670 --> 16:20.870
Manager Sun is right.

16:21.000 --> 16:23.130
There's indeed something wrong here.

16:23.240 --> 16:25.970
Looks like it's been spiked with
pine lampblack.

16:26.840 --> 16:27.840
Did you hear that?

16:28.840 --> 16:30.080
I, Sun Baiyi,

16:30.150 --> 16:32.110
have been working here for 6 to 7 years.

16:32.110 --> 16:34.480
Everyone knows I've got eagle eyes.

16:35.270 --> 16:37.550
Trying to fool me with such cheap tricks?

16:38.440 --> 16:39.450
You're way too green for that.

16:39.450 --> 16:41.140
I really didn't expect this.

16:41.840 --> 16:43.550
To think that the grand Li Ink

16:43.630 --> 16:46.000
would employ
such ignorant people like you.

16:46.000 --> 16:46.870
Nonsense.

16:47.390 --> 16:50.450
Manager Sun is the most
knowledgeable expert among us.

16:50.550 --> 16:52.510
If you had a better attitude,

16:52.870 --> 16:54.470
seeing how pitiful you look,

16:54.510 --> 16:55.440
I might accept it

16:55.480 --> 16:57.200
as low-grade lampblack

16:57.360 --> 17:00.030
to be used for cheap, coarse ink.

17:00.270 --> 17:01.840
And should I

17:01.910 --> 17:03.510
kneel and thank you for that?

17:04.109 --> 17:05.829
Then I'll proceed strictly by the book

17:05.829 --> 17:07.490
and confiscate your deposit.

17:07.720 --> 17:09.109
Since you're a young lady,

17:09.109 --> 17:10.000
I won't pursue

17:10.000 --> 17:11.160
any other charges.

17:12.069 --> 17:12.790
Everyone,

17:13.160 --> 17:15.400
wouldn't you say I'm being fair?

17:15.400 --> 17:16.160
Fair.

17:17.270 --> 17:18.790
Is Manager Sun fair or not?

17:18.810 --> 17:19.589
Absolutely fair.

17:19.589 --> 17:20.720
He's the fairest.

17:21.270 --> 17:22.400
-Fair.
-Fair.

17:25.000 --> 17:27.030
What an eye-opener today.

17:28.270 --> 17:29.510
I just won't believe

17:29.830 --> 17:31.090
that in all of Huizhou,

17:31.310 --> 17:33.920
there isn't a single person
who can recognize quality!

17:33.920 --> 17:34.680
Please.

17:35.720 --> 17:36.310
Next.

17:50.400 --> 17:51.110
Master.

17:51.680 --> 17:53.720
Nowadays, even if the Chen, Li,
and Pan families joined forces,

17:53.720 --> 17:55.920
they still wouldn't be enough
to rival the Tian family.

17:55.920 --> 17:57.680
The current Hui Ink workshops

17:57.720 --> 17:59.160
care only about fighting each other
for profit,

17:59.160 --> 18:00.750
with absolutely no interest in
reforming their craft.

18:00.750 --> 18:02.590
The prosperity of a decade ago,

18:02.790 --> 18:06.320
when master craftsmen emerged
one after another, is long gone.

18:12.480 --> 18:15.440
If the Tian family didn't have
the influence it has today,

18:15.440 --> 18:16.770
then my return this time

18:17.270 --> 18:18.930
would seem rather pointless.

18:20.830 --> 18:22.230
Let's head into the city.

18:30.000 --> 18:30.920
Everyone!

18:31.240 --> 18:34.500
The Huizhou ink industry has been
passed down for a century

18:34.620 --> 18:36.950
and is renowned throughout all of Huaxia.

18:37.240 --> 18:38.480
Behind this glory lies

18:38.480 --> 18:40.210
generations of Hui Ink makers,

18:40.240 --> 18:41.440
racking their brains

18:41.440 --> 18:42.880
to research recipes

18:43.070 --> 18:44.440
and working day and night

18:44.440 --> 18:45.550
to perfect their craft,

18:45.550 --> 18:47.720
and that is what created
today's prosperity.

18:47.720 --> 18:49.510
However, what makes Hui Ink
truly exceptional today,

18:49.510 --> 18:51.160
besides its exquisite production methods,

18:51.160 --> 18:53.640
is the meticulous selection
of ingredients.

18:53.640 --> 18:54.270
To guarantee supreme quality...

18:54.270 --> 18:55.030
Is Miss Li Zhen...

18:55.030 --> 18:56.110
Musk is added...

18:56.240 --> 18:57.350
Putting on a street performance
or something?

18:57.350 --> 18:58.350
To the ink.

18:58.440 --> 19:00.200
Who performs with a jar in their arms?

19:00.200 --> 19:01.240
What, is she doing magic tricks?

19:01.240 --> 19:02.070
And even...

19:02.110 --> 19:03.000
This girl

19:03.550 --> 19:04.590
-is full of crafty little schemes.
-The lampblack

19:04.590 --> 19:05.960
is incredibly demanding.

19:05.960 --> 19:06.790
As it happens,

19:06.790 --> 19:07.720
today I have a jar

19:07.720 --> 19:09.680
of lampblack here

19:09.720 --> 19:11.400
of exceptionally fine quality.

19:11.400 --> 19:12.680
Though this lampblack was obtained

19:12.680 --> 19:13.830
by burning lamp oil from

19:13.830 --> 19:15.640
Li Ink's lamp allotment,

19:16.200 --> 19:17.750
the smoke shed manager,

19:17.750 --> 19:18.790
Sun Baiyi,

19:18.790 --> 19:20.270
was blind to its worth.

19:20.480 --> 19:22.160
He insisted that my lampblack

19:22.160 --> 19:23.290
was of poor quality,

19:23.440 --> 19:24.750
confiscated my deposit,

19:24.750 --> 19:26.550
and refused to accept my lampblack!

19:26.550 --> 19:28.790
Since Li Ink won't accept it,

19:29.030 --> 19:29.880
fine then—

19:30.200 --> 19:32.510
I'll auction it off right here
on the street.

19:32.510 --> 19:33.830
Whoever recognizes its value

19:33.830 --> 19:36.090
and offers the highest price can have it!

19:38.270 --> 19:39.640
A street auction?

19:40.200 --> 19:41.070
It's been a long time

19:41.070 --> 19:42.940
since we've had this kind of excitement
here in Huizhou, right?

19:42.940 --> 19:44.140
-Yes.
-That's right.

19:44.850 --> 19:46.080
If this jar of lampblack

19:46.080 --> 19:47.830
is truly of premium quality,

19:47.880 --> 19:48.720
then Li Ink

19:48.790 --> 19:50.070
is in for trouble!

19:50.070 --> 19:51.930
Come on, let's head back to Li Ink.

19:54.960 --> 19:55.680
Hua'er,

19:56.160 --> 19:58.350
hurry and show everyone
our premium lampblack.

19:58.350 --> 19:58.920
Alright.

19:58.960 --> 19:59.830
Come on, everyone.

19:59.830 --> 20:00.790
Come take a look.

20:01.550 --> 20:02.070
Come on.

20:02.440 --> 20:03.790
Come and take a look, everyone.

20:03.790 --> 20:05.850
Our lampblack is of premium quality.

20:06.500 --> 20:08.200
This stuff doesn't look that great.

20:08.200 --> 20:09.070
It looks a bit grayish.

20:09.070 --> 20:09.880
Exactly.

20:10.000 --> 20:11.790
No wonder Li Ink wouldn't accept it.

20:11.790 --> 20:13.070
You two might not know this:

20:13.070 --> 20:14.270
the finer the lampblack,

20:14.270 --> 20:15.530
the lighter the color.

20:15.830 --> 20:16.920
If you can't tell,

20:16.940 --> 20:17.830
you can reach in

20:17.830 --> 20:19.510
and rub it with your fingers.

20:19.640 --> 20:20.110
Give it a try.

20:20.110 --> 20:21.030
Check it out. Come on.

20:21.030 --> 20:22.030
Try it. Try it.

20:24.590 --> 20:25.790
Look at it against the light.

20:25.790 --> 20:27.720
Doesn't the color look different?

20:28.880 --> 20:29.440
It's quite fine indeed.

20:29.440 --> 20:30.240
How is it?

20:30.240 --> 20:31.880
The color is different now, isn't it?

20:31.880 --> 20:32.830
That's what it's supposed to be like.

20:32.830 --> 20:33.720
Come on, let's continue.

20:33.720 --> 20:34.400
Come on.

20:34.560 --> 20:35.890
Come on, let me show you.

20:40.110 --> 20:41.110
Ink iridescence?

20:41.720 --> 20:45.520
Isn't that a phenomenon found
only in the most premium finished ink?

20:45.550 --> 20:46.510
You might be surprised to hear this,

20:46.510 --> 20:48.070
but it's not ink iridescence.

20:48.070 --> 20:49.200
It's simply that the lampblack
is extremely fine,

20:49.200 --> 20:51.000
and combined with the gloss of tung oil,

20:51.000 --> 20:53.000
it gives off this kind of lively luster.

20:53.000 --> 20:54.480
So according to what you're saying,

20:54.480 --> 20:56.420
-this is supreme-grade lampblack?
-Supreme-grade lampblack?

20:56.420 --> 20:57.240
Supreme-grade lampblack?

20:57.240 --> 20:59.480
Yes! This is indeed
supreme-grade lampblack!

20:59.480 --> 21:00.000
Come on!

21:00.000 --> 21:01.200
Everyone, take a look.

21:01.200 --> 21:02.750
Come and take a look.

21:03.590 --> 21:04.480
Let me see.

21:05.480 --> 21:05.900
Come on.

21:05.900 --> 21:06.350
Take a look.

21:06.350 --> 21:07.110
It really is.

21:07.130 --> 21:08.000
Take a look, everyone.

21:08.000 --> 21:10.830
You actually managed to make
supreme-grade lampblack?

21:10.830 --> 21:13.310
Could it be that
your grandfather helped you?

21:13.310 --> 21:14.160
Mr. Ma.

21:14.160 --> 21:15.830
This lampblack was indeed made by me.

21:15.830 --> 21:17.510
It has nothing to do with my grandfather.

21:17.510 --> 21:19.240
Li Ink refused to accept my lampblack,

21:19.240 --> 21:20.640
so I'm auctioning it here on the street,

21:20.640 --> 21:21.750
fair and square.

21:22.000 --> 21:23.550
If any of you still have doubts,

21:23.550 --> 21:24.960
you are more than welcome to go

21:24.960 --> 21:26.030
and verify the facts with me

21:26.030 --> 21:27.630
and that Sun Baiyi one by one.

21:33.200 --> 21:33.880
Alright!

21:33.960 --> 21:35.240
The starting price is 1 tael!

21:35.240 --> 21:36.640
The highest bidder wins!

21:37.510 --> 21:38.960
The highest bidder wins!

21:39.000 --> 21:40.600
The starting price is 1 tael?

21:40.680 --> 21:43.010
So what if it's of supreme-grade quality?

21:43.510 --> 21:45.400
It's just a jar of lampblack after all.

21:45.400 --> 21:45.880
Exactly.

21:45.880 --> 21:46.750
The starting price is too high.

21:46.750 --> 21:47.790
Who would buy it?

21:52.000 --> 21:53.110
Me. Me!

21:53.400 --> 21:55.590
I bid 1 tael and 5 mace!

21:55.590 --> 21:57.550
Alright, now the price
is 1 tael and 5 mace!

21:57.550 --> 21:58.480
One tael and 5 mace!

21:58.480 --> 22:00.160
One tael and 8 mace!

22:00.160 --> 22:01.640
Alright, one tael and 8 mace
from this gentleman!

22:01.640 --> 22:02.200
Two taels!

22:02.200 --> 22:03.270
I bid 2 taels!

22:03.270 --> 22:04.790
I bid 2 taels and 3 mace!

22:04.880 --> 22:06.310
I bid 2 taels and 8 mace!

22:06.720 --> 22:08.240
Two taels and 8 mace!

22:08.510 --> 22:09.550
I bid 3 taels!

22:09.550 --> 22:11.010
Three taels. Three taels.

22:11.200 --> 22:12.350
Three taels!

22:12.790 --> 22:13.790
Four taels!

22:14.310 --> 22:15.400
Four taels?

22:27.030 --> 22:27.720
Four taels!

22:27.720 --> 22:28.720
Any more bids?

22:29.160 --> 22:29.960
Four taels.

22:31.440 --> 22:32.960
Four taels of silver!

22:33.200 --> 22:34.270
Six taels!

22:35.400 --> 22:36.510
Six taels?

22:46.000 --> 22:47.240
Who is this guy?

22:47.720 --> 22:48.720
He looks a bit unfamiliar.

22:48.720 --> 22:51.160
Anyone else want to bid against my master?

22:51.640 --> 22:52.640
Six taels. Six taels, right?

22:52.640 --> 22:53.960
If not,

22:54.440 --> 22:56.110
then this jar of lampblack

22:56.590 --> 22:58.350
goes to my master.

22:58.930 --> 23:00.880
This young gentleman truly
knows his stuff.

23:00.880 --> 23:02.280
Is there anyone else here

23:02.310 --> 23:04.040
who would like to raise the bid?

23:04.830 --> 23:06.160
Me! Me!

23:06.960 --> 23:07.750
I... I...

23:08.110 --> 23:10.160
I bid 6 taels and

23:11.270 --> 23:12.110
1 mace.

23:17.000 --> 23:17.730
Seven taels.

23:22.640 --> 23:23.590
Eight taels.

23:25.680 --> 23:26.440
Nine taels.

23:26.680 --> 23:27.960
Nine taels?

23:28.350 --> 23:29.010
Nine taels?

23:29.510 --> 23:30.510
Li family!

23:30.880 --> 23:32.480
Ten taels from the Li family!

23:39.200 --> 23:40.790
Ten taels from the Li family?

23:40.790 --> 23:42.240
Why is the Li family here?

23:42.480 --> 23:43.270
Alright.

23:44.000 --> 23:45.480
Ten taels from Li Ink.

23:46.110 --> 23:47.750
Any higher bids?

23:48.240 --> 23:49.510
Fifteen taels!

23:54.750 --> 23:56.110
In all of Huizhou,

23:56.350 --> 23:59.400
there has never been lampblack
sold for 15 taels.

23:59.420 --> 24:00.150
Father.

24:00.440 --> 24:00.920
Father.

24:01.020 --> 24:02.920
Let's not lose our heads along with them.

24:02.920 --> 24:03.780
This lampblack

24:03.790 --> 24:05.200
is not worth 15 taels.

24:05.220 --> 24:06.180
Let them have it.

24:06.530 --> 24:09.500
[Sun Dahe, Master Ink Maker of Li Ink]

24:09.880 --> 24:11.310
I'm sorry, everyone.

24:11.920 --> 24:14.400
It was my foolish son
who lacked the eye for quality

24:14.400 --> 24:15.790
and made things difficult for you,
young lady,

24:15.790 --> 24:17.120
forcing you to resort to

24:17.310 --> 24:18.710
selling it on the street.

24:19.200 --> 24:21.720
Since the raw materials used to
make this lampblack

24:21.720 --> 24:23.250
were collected from Li Ink,

24:23.710 --> 24:25.910
it is only right that Li Ink buys it back.

24:27.980 --> 24:28.700
Young lady.

24:29.350 --> 24:31.750
Just now, this gentleman bid 15 taels.

24:32.310 --> 24:35.550
Would it be acceptable if Li Ink
repurchases this jar of lampblack

24:35.550 --> 24:36.280
for 15 taels?

24:36.560 --> 24:37.200
Father! Father!

24:37.200 --> 24:38.200
F-Fifteen taels?

24:38.920 --> 24:40.070
Stop arguing!

24:40.350 --> 24:41.200
Stop arguing!

24:43.720 --> 24:44.310
Father,

24:44.410 --> 24:46.270
15 taels? Have you lost your mind?

24:46.720 --> 24:47.480
Her?

24:48.030 --> 24:48.750
For this?

24:51.750 --> 24:52.270
She... She...

24:52.270 --> 24:54.800
She's able to make
supreme-grade lampblack?

24:55.030 --> 24:56.030
Impossible!

24:56.160 --> 24:57.750
Absolutely impossible!

24:58.030 --> 24:59.030
Anyway,

24:59.350 --> 25:00.410
I don't believe it.

25:00.550 --> 25:01.350
There's no way she can make it.

25:01.350 --> 25:02.350
You bastard!

25:02.350 --> 25:03.270
Still talking nonsense here!

25:03.270 --> 25:03.750
I...

25:04.310 --> 25:06.070
See how I deal with you
when we get back to the ink workshop.

25:06.070 --> 25:06.880
Now,

25:07.160 --> 25:09.240
apologize to the lady immediately.

25:09.240 --> 25:10.000
I won't!

25:10.020 --> 25:11.310
Why should I apologize to her?

25:11.310 --> 25:12.440
Look at this lampblack...

25:12.440 --> 25:12.900
Shut up!

25:16.310 --> 25:17.170
Interesting.

25:17.270 --> 25:18.070
Interesting.

25:19.790 --> 25:20.790
Just apologize already.

25:20.790 --> 25:24.200
Apologize! Apologize! Apologize!

25:24.440 --> 25:27.790
Apologize! Apologize! Apologize!

25:28.030 --> 25:31.960
Apologize! Apologize! Apologize!

25:34.720 --> 25:36.110
See? He apologized.

25:37.000 --> 25:38.410
Everyone, everyone.

25:39.790 --> 25:43.000
Since Li Ink has apologized to me,

25:43.480 --> 25:44.310
then this lampblack...

25:44.310 --> 25:45.070
Hold on.

25:46.480 --> 25:49.480
This buddy apologized very reluctantly.

25:49.830 --> 25:50.890
It doesn't matter.

25:51.350 --> 25:52.550
You don't believe it,

25:52.790 --> 25:53.790
but I do.

25:55.310 --> 25:58.040
Also, you all might have misunderstood
just now.

25:58.510 --> 26:00.160
When I said 15 taels,

26:00.550 --> 26:01.750
I didn't mean silver,

26:04.440 --> 26:06.790
but 15 taels of gold.

26:08.000 --> 26:08.930
15 taels of gold?

26:09.310 --> 26:10.640
15 taels of gold?

26:10.640 --> 26:11.510
So much money.

26:11.600 --> 26:12.840
Who is this exactly?

26:13.350 --> 26:15.070
No matter how rich the Li family is,

26:15.070 --> 26:15.830
they wouldn't do something like

26:15.830 --> 26:18.590
spending 15 taels of gold
on a jar of lampblack.

26:24.720 --> 26:27.070
This gentleman here
truly has an eye for quality.

26:27.070 --> 26:27.880
However,

26:27.880 --> 26:29.110
today's auction

26:29.750 --> 26:30.950
is hereby cancelled.

26:32.510 --> 26:34.000
-Cancelled?
-Cancelled?

26:36.200 --> 26:37.110
Why?

26:37.440 --> 26:39.640
Since when does anyone turn down money?

26:41.510 --> 26:42.200
Just as

26:42.200 --> 26:43.830
Master Sun just said,

26:44.110 --> 26:45.440
the raw materials and tools I used

26:45.440 --> 26:47.200
to produce this lampblack

26:47.240 --> 26:48.480
all came from Li Ink,

26:48.590 --> 26:49.720
so this lampblack

26:49.750 --> 26:50.750
should rightfully

26:50.750 --> 26:52.080
belong to Li Ink as well.

26:52.270 --> 26:53.510
I only held this street auction

26:53.510 --> 26:54.720
because Sun Baiyi

26:54.720 --> 26:56.200
deliberately humiliated me

26:56.200 --> 26:57.920
earlier,

26:58.030 --> 26:59.240
and I wanted to seek justice

26:59.240 --> 27:00.720
and preserve my dignity.

27:01.400 --> 27:02.400
But now that

27:03.070 --> 27:04.240
Li Ink

27:04.270 --> 27:06.000
has publicly apologized to me,

27:06.270 --> 27:07.160
I won't

27:07.160 --> 27:08.400
pursue this matter any further!

27:08.400 --> 27:09.400
Great!

27:16.830 --> 27:18.270
Besides, sir,

27:18.880 --> 27:20.610
the 15 taels of gold you offered

27:20.680 --> 27:22.440
far exceeds the true value of

27:22.440 --> 27:23.240
my lampblack.

27:23.550 --> 27:24.830
I cannot go against my conscience

27:24.830 --> 27:26.480
and do business with you at that price.

27:26.480 --> 27:27.110
How about this?

27:27.110 --> 27:27.920
Later,

27:27.920 --> 27:29.640
I'll make a new pot of lampblack

27:29.640 --> 27:32.270
for you for free

27:32.590 --> 27:33.720
as an apology.

27:33.750 --> 27:35.480
What do you think?

27:37.480 --> 27:38.440
No need.

27:39.680 --> 27:41.110
It seems this young lady

27:41.540 --> 27:43.820
is not someone who covets small gains.

27:45.480 --> 27:46.480
I'm impressed.

27:47.030 --> 27:49.240
I also wish this young lady

27:49.750 --> 27:51.240
prosperous business in the days ahead!

27:51.240 --> 27:51.880
Great!

27:52.270 --> 27:53.200
Thank you, sir.

27:56.310 --> 27:58.550
Great! Wonderful!

28:01.440 --> 28:03.570
Congratulations! Congratulations!

28:04.160 --> 28:05.400
Thank you, everyone.

28:05.720 --> 28:06.920
Thank you, everyone.

28:13.790 --> 28:15.960
The tools and raw materials are all here,

28:15.960 --> 28:17.240
caught red-handed!

28:17.270 --> 28:20.930
As expected, the supreme-grade lampblack
was made by Li Jinshui.

28:21.510 --> 28:22.510
Eighth Master Li,

28:22.590 --> 28:24.480
you treat an oath like a child's play.

28:24.480 --> 28:26.140
That's not very decent of you.

28:28.640 --> 28:29.590
President Hu.

28:30.720 --> 28:31.720
Eighth Master Li.

28:31.790 --> 28:33.610
Li Zhen's auctioning of
the supreme-grade lampblack

28:33.610 --> 28:37.070
that originally belonged to the Li family
openly on the street

28:37.270 --> 28:39.600
has already violated the industry taboo.

28:39.880 --> 28:40.720
And now,

28:41.240 --> 28:42.640
some people are convinced

28:42.640 --> 28:43.720
that the lampblack

28:43.880 --> 28:45.750
wasn't made by Li Zhen,

28:46.070 --> 28:47.480
but by you.

28:47.920 --> 28:48.960
Eighth Master Li,

28:49.480 --> 28:50.830
you'll have to explain this

28:50.830 --> 28:52.960
clearly to the Literary Association.

28:53.110 --> 28:53.790
President Hu.

28:53.790 --> 28:54.320
Jinshui.

28:54.790 --> 28:55.400
Jinshui?

28:56.680 --> 28:57.400
Hurry up

28:57.400 --> 28:59.160
and explain it clearly to everyone.

28:59.160 --> 29:00.070
Jinhe.

29:09.480 --> 29:10.720
This lampblack

29:10.750 --> 29:13.310
was made by our Zhen herself,
working day and night without rest.

29:13.310 --> 29:13.880
Why...

29:13.880 --> 29:16.480
Why do you have to make things
difficult for us?

29:17.640 --> 29:19.640
What's going on? What are you doing?

29:20.440 --> 29:21.370
What do you want?

29:21.400 --> 29:23.930
Why are you giving my grandfather
a hard time?

29:24.310 --> 29:26.160
You've only studied ink-making
for 3 years,

29:26.160 --> 29:28.440
yet you managed to
keep 30 lamps burning at once

29:28.440 --> 29:31.700
and produce 1 catty and 2 taels
of superb-grade lampblack?

29:32.400 --> 29:34.270
Although I don't know how to make ink,

29:34.270 --> 29:36.640
I'd like to ask the experts here—

29:37.000 --> 29:37.960
could you

29:38.030 --> 29:39.000
manage to do that

29:39.000 --> 29:41.200
after studying ink-making for 3 years?

29:41.960 --> 29:43.890
I wouldn't dare to boast like that.

29:44.310 --> 29:45.030
Li Zhen,

29:45.440 --> 29:48.160
you claim you can make
supreme-grade lampblack.

29:48.160 --> 29:49.360
Do you have any proof?

29:50.920 --> 29:52.070
Why is it you again?

29:52.750 --> 29:54.310
I just don't understand.

29:54.550 --> 29:55.550
You've spent decades

29:55.550 --> 29:56.960
toiling away

29:56.960 --> 29:58.270
without being able to make fine lampblack,

29:58.270 --> 30:00.160
so you insist that no one else can either?

30:00.160 --> 30:01.240
How ridiculous.

30:01.680 --> 30:02.680
Besides,

30:02.680 --> 30:03.880
it's understandable

30:03.880 --> 30:05.410
that the others don't know,

30:06.030 --> 30:07.640
but Sixth Grandfather

30:07.830 --> 30:09.310
and Uncle Jingdong,

30:09.480 --> 30:11.070
don't you guys really not know?

30:11.070 --> 30:12.750
When my grandfather
first started studying ink-making,

30:12.750 --> 30:15.410
he could easily make
supreme-grade lampblack.

30:15.480 --> 30:16.110
Later,

30:16.230 --> 30:18.830
he was even able to keep 35 lamps burning
at the same time.

30:18.830 --> 30:20.360
I'm his own granddaughter,

30:20.510 --> 30:22.480
personally taught by him.

30:22.590 --> 30:23.590
So why shouldn't I be able to

30:23.590 --> 30:25.160
inherit his craftsmanship?

30:25.160 --> 30:25.990
Wouldn't you agree,

30:25.990 --> 30:27.120
Sixth Grandfather?

30:28.770 --> 30:30.050
If you really can do it,

30:30.310 --> 30:32.510
then make some right here and let us see.

30:32.750 --> 30:34.080
Who do you think you are?

30:34.510 --> 30:35.310
Tian Bensheng,

30:35.310 --> 30:36.400
do you know how to make ink?

30:36.400 --> 30:37.350
You don't even know

30:37.350 --> 30:38.000
what lampblack-making is, do you?

30:38.000 --> 30:38.310
I...

30:38.760 --> 30:40.690
Why should I prove anything to you?

30:43.270 --> 30:44.070
President Hu.

30:44.440 --> 30:45.480
If you don't believe me,

30:45.480 --> 30:46.790
I can prove it to you.

30:47.440 --> 30:48.270
It's just that for now,

30:48.270 --> 30:50.080
I've already used up all the materials
in my smoke shed.

30:50.080 --> 30:51.430
Once I buy new ones,

30:51.640 --> 30:53.030
you're free to inspect it
however you like.

30:53.030 --> 30:54.750
What's so hard about that?

30:55.070 --> 30:56.790
Our Tian family has plenty of materials.

30:56.790 --> 30:57.550
Master Zeng.

30:57.880 --> 30:59.830
Send someone back to Tian's Ink Workshop

30:59.830 --> 31:01.350
and bring over the finest fresh materials.

31:01.350 --> 31:01.880
Okay.

31:02.270 --> 31:04.270
I wouldn't dare!

31:04.910 --> 31:07.210
I wouldn't dare use
your Tian family's things.

31:07.210 --> 31:09.450
Who knows if your Tian family is trying

31:09.480 --> 31:10.480
to plot something again.

31:10.480 --> 31:10.920
You...

31:11.070 --> 31:12.550
Making all kinds of excuses!

31:12.550 --> 31:14.640
You clearly just don't dare to
make lampblack in public.

31:14.640 --> 31:15.770
Why wouldn't I dare?

31:15.830 --> 31:17.550
I just don't want to show you
how I make it.

31:17.550 --> 31:18.240
Why should I show you?

31:18.240 --> 31:18.880
I won't watch.

31:18.880 --> 31:20.070
I just want President Hu to watch it.

31:20.070 --> 31:21.070
Then what does that have to do with you?

31:21.070 --> 31:22.200
-Go home!
-You guys!

31:24.000 --> 31:25.480
All of you grown men

31:25.750 --> 31:27.400
ganging up on a young lady—

31:27.920 --> 31:29.650
do you think it's appropriate?

31:30.400 --> 31:31.660
Seventh Grandmother.

31:32.470 --> 31:33.590
Why are you here?

31:34.550 --> 31:35.400
Zhen.

31:36.350 --> 31:38.150
I brought you the raw materials.

31:38.640 --> 31:41.370
You can make lampblack
right here for them to see.

31:47.240 --> 31:48.840
I can demonstrate it for you,

31:49.400 --> 31:50.400
but as for them...

31:50.880 --> 31:51.750
Dear.

31:52.880 --> 31:54.960
You've studied ink-making for 3 years,

31:54.960 --> 31:56.310
yet I've never

31:56.680 --> 31:57.790
truly seen

31:58.160 --> 32:00.160
your real skills.

32:02.070 --> 32:03.000
President Hu.

32:03.400 --> 32:04.310
Master Tian.

32:04.480 --> 32:05.550
If Zhen

32:05.720 --> 32:06.790
manage to make

32:06.920 --> 32:08.680
supreme-grade lampblack on the spot,

32:08.680 --> 32:10.200
will you be convinced?

32:10.510 --> 32:11.790
Of course we'll be convinced.

32:11.790 --> 32:13.480
Seeing is believing, you know.

32:13.480 --> 32:14.160
Zhen.

32:21.070 --> 32:23.440
I originally didn't want to
bother with you guys,

32:23.440 --> 32:24.640
but since my Seventh Grandmother

32:24.640 --> 32:26.200
has come in person today,

32:26.830 --> 32:27.680
I'd like to

32:28.110 --> 32:29.000
take this opportunity

32:29.000 --> 32:30.160
to let you see

32:30.480 --> 32:31.960
whether my ink-making skills

32:31.960 --> 32:33.620
have improved over the years.

32:35.920 --> 32:36.590
Doggie.

32:36.790 --> 32:37.640
Unload the cargo.

32:37.640 --> 32:38.160
Yes.

32:38.640 --> 32:39.570
There's no rush.

32:40.030 --> 32:41.400
The quality of lampblack-making

32:41.400 --> 32:43.240
also involves an element of luck.

32:43.240 --> 32:44.550
If she only lights 1 or 2 lamps,

32:44.550 --> 32:46.510
what if she gets lucky

32:46.550 --> 32:48.750
and happens to produce something good?

32:49.110 --> 32:51.160
Since we're witnessing it on the spot,

32:51.160 --> 32:52.110
she should,

32:52.200 --> 32:53.960
as Master Li said,

32:54.160 --> 32:55.110
light 30 lamps

32:55.110 --> 32:56.270
at once.

32:56.510 --> 32:59.480
If she can't make enough
supreme-grade lampblack,

32:59.750 --> 33:01.200
then it shouldn't count.

33:01.660 --> 33:04.570
Isn't that going too far?

33:05.350 --> 33:06.920
If she can do it, go ahead.

33:07.400 --> 33:08.240
If she can't, then...

33:08.240 --> 33:09.400
I can.

33:10.440 --> 33:11.960
Isn't it just 30 lamps?

33:13.960 --> 33:15.220
Seventh Grandmother.

33:15.720 --> 33:16.440
I, Zhen,

33:16.830 --> 33:17.680
can manage.

33:22.510 --> 33:23.510
Eighth Master Li.

33:23.790 --> 33:24.920
To avoid arousing suspicion,

33:24.920 --> 33:27.350
it's not appropriate for you
to stay inside, is it?

33:27.350 --> 33:30.010
My grandfather is just helping me
set things up.

33:31.880 --> 33:32.510
Grandfather.

33:32.510 --> 33:33.240
Don't worry.

33:33.480 --> 33:34.680
I can do this on my own.

33:41.540 --> 33:43.670
Even sitting here isn't appropriate.

33:44.310 --> 33:45.710
You should step outside.

34:00.000 --> 34:01.330
Let's get started then.

34:12.710 --> 34:14.400
Lighting 1 lamp.

34:20.760 --> 34:22.280
Lighting 2 lamps.

34:24.480 --> 34:25.550
Three lamps.

34:27.760 --> 34:28.670
Four lamps.

34:31.000 --> 34:31.880
Five lamps.

34:41.590 --> 34:43.190
Losing your grip already?

34:43.920 --> 34:44.840
Master Li,

34:45.820 --> 34:47.750
upright and honorable, remember?

35:34.230 --> 35:35.110
Lighting

35:35.190 --> 35:36.360
30 lamps.

35:41.150 --> 35:42.590
Master Jingdong of the Li family,

35:42.590 --> 35:45.160
if she really manages to make
supreme-grade lampblack in front of us,

35:45.160 --> 35:47.290
your Li family will suffer a huge loss.

35:49.280 --> 35:51.480
Not as much as the Tian family, alright?

35:51.920 --> 35:53.000
Get lost.

35:57.550 --> 35:58.510
Who couldn't light

35:58.510 --> 35:59.480
30 lamps?

36:00.000 --> 36:02.660
But making supreme-grade lampblack...
Humph.

36:36.550 --> 36:37.480
A peaceful mind

36:37.550 --> 36:38.510
means

36:38.800 --> 36:40.480
the ultimate truth is found
in absolute simplicity.

36:40.480 --> 36:42.230
With zero distractions,

36:44.370 --> 36:45.480
there's nothing else in this universe

36:45.480 --> 36:47.210
except the lamps and yourself.

36:51.190 --> 36:53.650
Do you have any
translucent strips of cloth?

36:53.800 --> 36:55.460
Translucent strips of cloth?

37:02.000 --> 37:02.710
Yes.

37:08.670 --> 37:09.480
Zhen,

37:09.710 --> 37:10.880
will this work?

37:12.670 --> 37:13.320
It will.

37:27.320 --> 37:28.360
Let me help you.

37:45.630 --> 37:46.590
Is she going to

37:46.670 --> 37:48.330
make lampblack blindfolded?

38:01.510 --> 38:02.440
Father.

38:02.510 --> 38:04.400
You light so many lamps every day.

38:04.400 --> 38:05.670
Isn't it boring?

38:05.710 --> 38:07.550
Not at all.

38:09.230 --> 38:11.150
I find it quite boring.

38:12.410 --> 38:13.040
Father,

38:13.070 --> 38:14.840
why don't you find it boring?

38:18.510 --> 38:20.840
What do you see above the flame?

38:27.280 --> 38:28.800
Nothing at all.

38:28.800 --> 38:29.760
Open your eyes wide

38:29.760 --> 38:30.760
and look closely.

38:36.840 --> 38:38.400
There's a lot of smoke.

38:38.480 --> 38:39.480
Look closely.

38:40.070 --> 38:41.550
Doesn't it look like

38:42.670 --> 38:45.360
the butterfly I caught for you?

38:46.510 --> 38:48.070
It does.

38:48.550 --> 38:50.150
Look, it changed again.

38:50.630 --> 38:53.560
Does this look like
the kite Zhengliang made for you?

38:53.840 --> 38:54.800
And over there.

38:54.800 --> 38:56.460
That plume looks like a snake.

38:57.190 --> 38:57.640
You're right.

38:57.640 --> 38:59.170
This plume looks like a fly.

39:01.280 --> 39:02.320
There's more. There's more.

39:02.320 --> 39:04.320
This plume looks like New Year Cake.

39:04.670 --> 39:06.070
Look at you.

39:06.710 --> 39:08.840
You can even see food in the smoke.

39:09.030 --> 39:10.030
Little glutton.

39:11.590 --> 39:12.760
Close your eyes.

39:17.400 --> 39:20.230
What sound can you hear?

39:22.960 --> 39:24.590
I can hear you speaking.

39:24.920 --> 39:26.670
I meant the sound of the smoke.

39:38.150 --> 39:40.760
Can you hear the distant sound

39:40.920 --> 39:42.320
of firecrackers?

39:44.480 --> 39:45.320
Yes.

39:47.510 --> 39:48.960
Now,

39:49.110 --> 39:50.280
don't look

39:50.760 --> 39:51.880
and don't listen—

39:52.480 --> 39:54.960
be like the little dog in the courtyard.

39:55.400 --> 39:57.000
Use only your nose.

39:58.150 --> 40:00.150
What can you smell?

40:02.230 --> 40:03.760
A smell of greasy smoke.

40:04.030 --> 40:04.880
When you unify

40:04.880 --> 40:05.630
sight,

40:06.190 --> 40:07.030
hearing,

40:07.510 --> 40:08.240
and smelling

40:08.960 --> 40:11.000
like this

40:12.070 --> 40:14.070
and open your mind's eye,

40:15.190 --> 40:18.920
even though this is just a small room,

40:19.920 --> 40:22.470
it contains 32 peaks,

40:23.590 --> 40:25.720
cliffs and springs, birds and beasts,

40:28.110 --> 40:30.400
mist and clouds—

40:32.430 --> 40:34.110
towering and majestic,

40:35.800 --> 40:38.150
4,000 fathoms high.

42:17.920 --> 42:19.250
This is supreme-grade.

42:19.740 --> 42:21.350
It is indeed supreme-grade.

42:32.710 --> 42:35.240
It doesn't look like supreme-grade,
does it?

42:42.760 --> 42:43.760
Eighth Master Li.

42:44.030 --> 42:45.320
Your granddaughter

42:45.710 --> 42:47.150
is truly impressive.
